1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 17=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:53,430
The bed curtains and bedding have all
been replaced with new ones.

7
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,360
We had very little time,

8
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:55,919
so the preparations may
not be quite complete.

9
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,718
Third Young Lady, if you need anything,

10
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,119
just let me know.

11
00:01:59,432 --> 00:02:01,790
Baogai has gone to prepare
some hot water for you to drink.

12
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:03,358
It should be brought over shortly.

13
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:05,919
Someone will also bring hot water
first thing tomorrow morning.

14
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,639
I'm fine.

15
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,768
See to Aunt Lingxiao and Jinlan first.

16
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:12,079
It's fine. There's enough for everyone.

17
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,680
Lanxiang!

18
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,878
First Madam knows Jinlan
shouldn't be burdened with worry,

19
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,559
yet she put him in charge.

20
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,199
In truth, she's relying on you.

21
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:39,799
Jinqi also said he trusts you.

22
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:43,479
Clearly, you're capable and dependable.

23
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,918
You're too kind, Third Young Lady.

24
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:48,799
I'll naturally do my utmost
to carry out my masters' instructions.

25
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,160
Please sit.

26
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,840
When I went to see Jinqi
at the Hour of Xu,

27
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,440
he asked why
I hadn't brought a maid with me.

28
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:01,280
I sent Tongcao to follow Lingdang.

29
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:03,918
Tongcao,

30
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,038
tell Lanxiang

31
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,479
what you saw.

32
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,799
After leaving Zhichun Hall,

33
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:13,759
Young Lady Du
said something to Lingdang,

34
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:15,799
and Lingdang left.

35
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,519
I followed Lingdang the whole way.

36
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,440
She was very cautious,

37
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,519
constantly looking around.

38
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,000
But I was born into the Lin household

39
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:27,890
and have served
Young Lady since I was little.

40
00:03:28,008 --> 00:03:30,790
I know the residence so well that
I could walk it with my eyes closed.

41
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,799
Naturally, she couldn't spot me.

42
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,359
Later,

43
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:38,079
I followed Lingdang
to Second Young Master's courtyard.

44
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:40,880
Lingdang didn't go inside either.

45
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:44,759
She just said something to two maids
who were delivering hot water,

46
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,359
and then left.

47
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,079
I followed Lingdang back to Luxue Lodge.

48
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,730
After I saw them
lock the courtyard gate,

49
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:54,519
I returned to Yujiao Garden
and reported back to Young Lady.

50
00:03:57,479 --> 00:04:00,280
It does sound like there's
something odd about Lingdang.

51
00:04:00,290 --> 00:04:03,230
Why wouldn't she accompany Young Lady Du
back to her room so late at night?

52
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,630
I thought it was strange, too,

53
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,400
so I couldn't help telling you.

54
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,999
For now, there's nothing clearly wrong.

55
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,919
But...

56
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,840
But...

57
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:18,719
Lingdang did come
from outside the household, after all.

58
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,079
You can never truly know
what's in someone's heart.

59
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:24,559
Now that we're living
in the same courtyard,

60
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,480
and First Madam
has put you in charge,

61
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:29,839
I thought I should tell you,

62
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,440
so you can be on your guard...

63
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,480
and be prepared.

64
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:39,320
Please don't think I'm meddling.

65
00:04:39,330 --> 00:04:41,239
After all, we should
never seek to harm others,

66
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,079
but we must always guard against them.

67
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,438
Don't worry, Third Young Lady.

68
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:56,079
I'll be sure to keep an eye on

69
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,279
Lingdang.

70
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:08,199
I won't keep you from your work, then.

71
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,839
Go on and get back to it.

72
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,480
Lanxiang.

73
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,079
It's dark at night.

74
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,279
Take this.

75
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:58,800
You're back.

76
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,320
We still have duties tomorrow morning.

77
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,279
Get some sleep.

78
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:14,199
You and I have taken turns looking
after Yuchan these past two days.

79
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,399
Neither of us
has developed a single rash.

80
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,959
But Xiaolian...

81
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:21,078
Everyone else at Luxue Lodge is fine.

82
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,800
She's the only one who fell ill.

83
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:27,199
You were with Second Madam today.

84
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,639
Did Young Lady Du say anything to you?

85
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:34,399
Young Lady Du chatted with me for a bit.

86
00:06:34,888 --> 00:06:37,070
She remarked on how hard
Young Master had been working,

87
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:39,199
having to go out
right after taking a bath.

88
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,800
What's wrong?

89
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:49,079
Tell me exactly
what Young Lady Du said again.

90
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:54,079
Young Lady Du said Young Master
had been working hard,

91
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,680
having to go out
right after taking a bath.

92
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,040
What did you say?

93
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:02,040
I've been looking
after Yuchan this whole time.

94
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,159
How would I know
when Young Master went out?

95
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,359
I just smiled and agreed,

96
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,640
saying that Young Master
had indeed been working hard,

97
00:07:09,704 --> 00:07:11,190
and then I left.

98
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,920
A bath...

99
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:17,399
Lingdang went to Qingyan Hall.

100
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,800
The maids carrying water...

101
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,800
No.

102
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,759
Hot water.

103
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,000
Baogai.

104
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,360
Where do you need hot water?

105
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,360
I don't need any hot water.

106
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:49,959
I just came to talk to you.

107
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,360
At this hour?

108
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:53,959
What could be so important?

109
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:59,999
The day Young Master
returned from the prison,

110
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,438
the same day Yuchan and I

111
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,639
returned from
the Naval Camp outside the city,

112
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,360
did Lingdang come by?

113
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,320
She did.

114
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,199
Are you sure?

115
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:11,839
I'm sure.

116
00:08:11,864 --> 00:08:13,310
It was only the afternoon that day,

117
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:15,398
but you and Yuchan
wanted hot water for a bath.

118
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,592
I hurried to have
the junior maids heat some water.

119
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:21,360
I still remember there
wasn't enough the first time.

120
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:23,880
So I had another two buckets
of hot water heated for you.

121
00:08:24,184 --> 00:08:26,750
Lingdang came when you were
heating the first batch of water?

122
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:30,880
I suffer from menstrual cramps.

123
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,239
After Lingdang found out,

124
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,280
she asked Young Lady Du
for some medicine for me.

125
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,719
That day, she came to bring me the pills

126
00:08:36,759 --> 00:08:38,599
just as I was
busy telling the junior maids

127
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,479
to bring hot water to Yuchan and you.

128
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:44,119
She even waited for a while.

129
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,119
After I finished,

130
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,839
she explained how to take the medicine.

131
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:51,599
That day, Xiaolian came to see me.

132
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:54,119
We talked for a while,

133
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:56,959
and just then, Yuchan said
she didn't have enough hot water,

134
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:59,879
so I gave her mine.

135
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:04,359
Early the next morning,
Yuchan developed a red rash.

136
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:10,199
You came all this way late at night

137
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:12,320
just to ask about this?

138
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:14,158
No one can know

139
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,760
that I asked you about this.

140
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:24,680
(Could the epidemic
be something other than an illness?)

141
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,280
(Young Master,
aren't you going to take a bath?)

142
00:10:22,399 --> 00:10:24,518
(I poured in a whole bucket
of hot water just now)

143
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:26,560
(to make some splashing sounds.)

144
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:27,999
(It's a little hot.)

145
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,798
It's me.

146
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:41,839
Nanke.

147
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,520
I recognized you.

148
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,839
Has First Madam moved here?

149
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,798
First Madam
is still at Rongzhang House.

150
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,832
She said she needs
to look after Fourth Young Lady.

151
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,320
I suspect the epidemic in the residence

152
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:09,400
isn't an illness,

153
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,800
but someone poisoning people.

154
00:11:12,904 --> 00:11:13,864
You were sneaking around

155
00:11:13,912 --> 00:11:16,520
because you suspect there's
something wrong with the bathwater?

156
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,319
The maids are very careful

157
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,999
with the masters' food.

158
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,800
It's kept covered,

159
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:24,520
so it's not easy to tamper with.

160
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,760
But the hot water for bathing

161
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,719
isn't watched as closely

162
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,400
when the maids deliver it.

163
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,319
I suspect

164
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:35,280
someone has
been poisoning the bathwater.

165
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,199
Who do you suspect?

166
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,199
Young Lady Du and Lingdang.

167
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,839
It's only a suspicion.

168
00:11:51,879 --> 00:11:53,640
Perhaps I'm overthinking it.

169
00:12:01,799 --> 00:12:02,800
Let me.

170
00:12:16,264 --> 00:12:17,576
Please take this to Young Master

171
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:19,560
and ask him to
have an imperial physician

172
00:12:19,570 --> 00:12:21,688
from the Imperial Medical Service
examine it.

173
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,560
All right.

174
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,520
There's one more thing

175
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:31,160
I'd like to ask your help with.

176
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:39,020
(Father, Mother, please don't worry.
Your daughter, Lanxiang)

177
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:44,599
It must be wonderful
to know how to read and write.

178
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,079
If you want to learn,

179
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,280
I'll teach you.

180
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,479
Really?

181
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,479
Can I learn?

182
00:12:54,279 --> 00:12:57,398
My father learned
to read and write from me.

183
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:58,839
As long as we're determined,

184
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,840
if we learn two
or three characters every day,

185
00:13:00,904 --> 00:13:03,390
we'll know around
a thousand after a year.

186
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:05,400
That's enough
for everyday reading and writing.

187
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,398
I am.

188
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:07,680
I'm determined.

189
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,920
Can she be trusted?

190
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,280
First Madam
has developed a red rash, too.

191
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,999
First Madam
took a bath during the day?

192
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:34,790
First Madam said she

193
00:13:34,808 --> 00:13:37,590
worked up a sweat while looking after
Fourth Young Lady during the day,

194
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,239
so she had the maids prepare hot water

195
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,400
for a bath.

196
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:43,079
Du Cuique and Du Zheng came
to pay their respects at the time

197
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,119
and heard her.

198
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,719
What did First Madam say?

199
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,158
Until we have solid evidence,

200
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:48,719
we must not act rashly.

201
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,456
The Lin family
cannot afford to be accused

202
00:13:50,472 --> 00:13:51,950
of plotting to harm their lifesavers.

203
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,980
(Lin Residence)

204
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:14,072
These are First Madam's household
authority token and seal.

205
00:14:15,159 --> 00:14:16,800
First Madam said...

206
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,920
(Lin Residence)
Second Madam is kindhearted,

207
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:23,359
but easily swayed
and quick to believe rumors.

208
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,760
She can't handle important matters.

209
00:14:25,399 --> 00:14:26,678
Jinlan is intelligent,

210
00:14:26,679 --> 00:14:28,199
but he has a heart condition.

211
00:14:29,159 --> 00:14:31,440
Jinqiao may look big and strong,

212
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:34,040
but he's still a child at heart.

213
00:14:35,679 --> 00:14:38,119
Second Young Madam
comes from humble origins

214
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,719
and is timid by nature.

215
00:14:40,328 --> 00:14:42,920
She can't keep the people and affairs
of the residence in order.

216
00:14:43,919 --> 00:14:47,280
Xiuwan is spoiled, while Xiuru is timid.

217
00:14:48,536 --> 00:14:50,430
There are so many masters
in this residence,

218
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,479
yet not one of them
can manage the household.

219
00:14:58,399 --> 00:15:01,079
I know about the things Lanxiang

220
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,440
has done for Young Master.

221
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:04,800
She's intelligent and capable.

222
00:15:05,224 --> 00:15:07,230
Desperate times call
for exceptional measures.

223
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:11,199
I'm entrusting
the inner residence to Lanxiang.

224
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:13,959
If I fall unconscious with a fever

225
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,439
before Young Master returns,

226
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,158
Lanxiang will take these

227
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:19,096
and assist Jinlan
in managing the household.

228
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,719
Xiushu's life and mine,

229
00:15:23,576 --> 00:15:25,800
as well as the lives
of everyone in Fengqi Courtyard,

230
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,079
will all be entrusted to Lanxiang.

231
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:36,879
The letter.

232
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,079
Thank you.

233
00:16:03,704 --> 00:16:06,280
There's something about
Young Lady Du I need to tell you.

234
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,199
What is it?

235
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,878
When I was chatting
with Young Lady Du earlier,

236
00:16:14,879 --> 00:16:16,319
she was about to go to bed.

237
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,839
I saw that she was wearing

238
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,558
an undershirt made of Xinggu gauze.

239
00:16:19,559 --> 00:16:21,638
I've only ever seen this fabric once.

240
00:16:21,639 --> 00:16:24,239
It was when
Young Madam Zhao was staying here.

241
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:26,320
She had two undershirts like this.

242
00:16:26,399 --> 00:16:28,678
She said they were
woven from banana fibers

243
00:16:28,679 --> 00:16:29,959
and were extremely precious.

244
00:16:30,639 --> 00:16:32,520
But how could Young Lady Du

245
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:34,760
have such expensive clothing?

246
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,560
It was a gift.

247
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:41,398
That person also gave her
Yunzi stones worth a fortune

248
00:16:41,399 --> 00:16:43,199
to win Du Cuique's favor.

249
00:16:43,559 --> 00:16:44,320
Well...

250
00:16:49,639 --> 00:16:51,479
Yuchan and Xiaolian

251
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,479
are both at Fengqi Courtyard now.

252
00:16:53,919 --> 00:16:55,719
Is there anything I can do to help?

253
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,800
Yes.

254
00:16:58,919 --> 00:17:02,119
When you serve Second Young Master
and Second Young Madam tomorrow,

255
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,680
quietly ask around.

256
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,040
What are you doing?

257
00:17:31,599 --> 00:17:33,439
What do you want?

258
00:17:34,559 --> 00:17:35,720
Let go of me!

259
00:18:12,799 --> 00:18:14,320
You're a grown man.

260
00:18:14,359 --> 00:18:17,240
Why do you look like you've seen
a ghost when you see me?

261
00:18:20,839 --> 00:18:22,720
Who knew you'd be up
in the middle of the night

262
00:18:22,830 --> 00:18:24,760
and suddenly show up
outside the military camp?

263
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:26,712
I have some private business
that may get bloody.

264
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:29,159
I need the brothers' help.

265
00:18:29,464 --> 00:18:31,350
That's why
I had to gather everyone in secret.

266
00:18:31,359 --> 00:18:32,798
The brothers are all ready.

267
00:18:32,799 --> 00:18:34,038
Let's get to it.

268
00:18:34,039 --> 00:18:34,758
Enough talk.

269
00:18:34,759 --> 00:18:35,879
Let's do it.

270
00:18:36,839 --> 00:18:37,919
Good.

271
00:18:38,319 --> 00:18:39,560
Let's do it.

272
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:41,399
That's my brother.

273
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,240
Just like before,

274
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,679
I'm trusting you

275
00:18:48,559 --> 00:18:49,919
to watch my back.

276
00:18:50,119 --> 00:18:51,040
All right.

277
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,960
As long as I'm still breathing,

278
00:18:54,839 --> 00:18:57,399
no one will lay a hand
on you from behind.

279
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,320
Let's go.

280
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:01,358
We need to leave the city

281
00:19:01,359 --> 00:19:02,639
as soon as the gates open.

282
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,520
Try not to alert anyone.

283
00:19:06,559 --> 00:19:07,320
All right.

284
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,760
I'll change into civilian clothes.

285
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:09,784
You go on ahead.

286
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:10,838
I'll catch up with you.

287
00:19:10,839 --> 00:19:12,119
Already taken care of.

288
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:19,280
I still need a different weapon.

289
00:19:19,599 --> 00:19:20,679
Don't worry.

290
00:19:24,359 --> 00:19:26,119
We've prepared a weapon for you, too.

291
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,439
No one will see through your disguise.

292
00:19:36,359 --> 00:19:38,038
We're going to fight,

293
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:39,278
not meet a prospective bride.

294
00:19:39,279 --> 00:19:40,598
Why all the fuss?

295
00:19:40,599 --> 00:19:41,639
Let's go.

296
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:57,180
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

297
00:20:14,079 --> 00:20:15,480
Is this all we have?

298
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,038
Given the circumstances,

299
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:21,439
First Madam said
we'll have to make do.

300
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:24,800
Just make do with this.

301
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,359
Go ahead and eat.

302
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,159
We only have eggs right now.

303
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:35,639
Here.

304
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,800
You can have this, too.

305
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,079
I don't want it.

306
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,679
I'll just have some porridge.

307
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,879
Then don't eat it plain.

308
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:44,240
It's too bland.

309
00:20:44,359 --> 00:20:45,520
Have some pickles.

310
00:21:05,559 --> 00:21:06,720
Cuique.

311
00:21:16,088 --> 00:21:17,128
I asked Fufang about it.

312
00:21:17,176 --> 00:21:20,240
Yesterday at the Hour of Xu,
the one who asked for hot water to bathe

313
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:21,760
was Concubine Zhou.

314
00:21:26,799 --> 00:21:28,079
Keep an eye on things here.

315
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:31,679
Take special care
of Young Lady Du and Lingdang.

316
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:47,359
Don't just eat porridge.

317
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,760
Have some pickles.

318
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,439
Second Young Master,
Second Young Madam.

319
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,480
Where is Concubine Zhou?

320
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:02,518
She wanted to sleep a little longer.

321
00:22:02,519 --> 00:22:04,240
She hasn't left her room.

322
00:22:09,559 --> 00:22:10,839
What's the matter?

323
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:11,760
Just tell us.

324
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:24,320
Concubine Zhou
may have developed a red rash.

325
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:35,879
Mother.

326
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,399
Mother.

327
00:22:44,799 --> 00:22:46,560
Mother, open the door.

328
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:50,720
Mother, open the door.

329
00:22:51,079 --> 00:22:52,399
Don't come in.

330
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:54,118
Stay away from me.

331
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:55,480
As far away as possible.

332
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:57,720
Mother.

333
00:22:58,319 --> 00:22:59,598
Mother, come out and talk to me.

334
00:22:59,599 --> 00:23:02,719
I should've stayed
at Qingyan Hall last night.

335
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:05,280
I shouldn't have come here with you.

336
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,560
Jinlan, are you all right?

337
00:23:08,119 --> 00:23:09,399
Don't get worked up.

338
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:11,679
Jinlan, don't get worked up.

339
00:23:11,799 --> 00:23:13,560
I'm fine.

340
00:23:14,599 --> 00:23:16,639
Don't make yourself ill.

341
00:23:17,880 --> 00:23:18,679
Don't worry.

342
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,919
Second Young Master.
Please don't get worked up.

343
00:23:23,319 --> 00:23:25,318
I'm in a hurry
to take care of something.

344
00:23:25,319 --> 00:23:27,479
Young Master is already
trying to find a solution.

345
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,639
I promise

346
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:30,280
everything will be fine.

347
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:01,439
Lingdang.

348
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:04,079
Lingdang.

349
00:24:06,759 --> 00:24:08,879
Lingdang.

350
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:22,399
Lingdang! How did this happen?

351
00:24:23,119 --> 00:24:25,399
My poor Lingdang.

352
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,560
Lingdang.

353
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,318
Lingdang, hold on.

354
00:24:29,319 --> 00:24:30,318
Lingdang.

355
00:24:30,319 --> 00:24:31,800
I can save you.

356
00:24:32,319 --> 00:24:33,399
Lingdang!

357
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,399
Lingdang!

358
00:24:38,799 --> 00:24:39,679
Lingdang.

359
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,038
I know medicine.

360
00:24:41,039 --> 00:24:41,639
I can save you.

361
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:43,480
I promise I'll save you, Lingdang.

362
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,439
Lingdang.

363
00:24:47,119 --> 00:24:48,119
Lingdang.

364
00:24:48,319 --> 00:24:49,359
Lingdang.

365
00:24:50,319 --> 00:24:54,159
Young Lady...

366
00:24:57,519 --> 00:25:00,119
- Lingdang.
- Lingdang.

367
00:25:01,759 --> 00:25:02,760
Lingdang.

368
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,320
Lingdang.

369
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:28,439
Lingdang.

370
00:25:36,400 --> 00:25:38,119
Lingdang.

371
00:25:40,319 --> 00:25:41,639
Lingdang.

372
00:25:53,839 --> 00:25:55,560
Lingdang.

373
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,560
Lingdang.

374
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,239
- Come back.
- Cuique.

375
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,800
Don't be sad.

376
00:26:09,839 --> 00:26:11,078
She's already gone.

377
00:26:11,079 --> 00:26:12,239
You need to leave now.

378
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,679
You'll catch the epidemic.

379
00:26:13,799 --> 00:26:15,318
Please, just get out of here.

380
00:26:15,319 --> 00:26:16,200
Go.

381
00:26:16,559 --> 00:26:17,800
Lingdang.

382
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,639
Lingdang.

383
00:26:26,559 --> 00:26:27,720
Lanxiang.

384
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:30,800
Lingdang.

385
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:37,118
Lingdang's body can't stay here.

386
00:26:37,119 --> 00:26:38,919
Notify Yinchen at once.

387
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:41,879
The one delivering the food
is still outside.

388
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:43,560
They already know.

389
00:27:10,799 --> 00:27:11,558
You two,

390
00:27:11,559 --> 00:27:12,679
go lift the curtain.

391
00:27:19,839 --> 00:27:21,119
She has a fever.

392
00:27:24,400 --> 00:27:25,960
How is Fourth Young Lady?

393
00:27:26,799 --> 00:27:28,320
Her fever hasn't broken.

394
00:27:28,559 --> 00:27:29,879
She's still unconscious.

395
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:33,159
The red rashes all over her body
have festered and ulcerated.

396
00:27:34,799 --> 00:27:36,159
First Madam was already

397
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:41,040
deeply distressed
seeing Fourth Young Lady like that.

398
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,879
It's only making her feel worse.

399
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,320
What about Xiaolian and Yuchan?

400
00:27:48,319 --> 00:27:50,119
Xiaolian is unconscious, too.

401
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,800
Yuchan is in the worst condition.

402
00:27:53,759 --> 00:27:55,480
The experienced nannies said

403
00:27:55,559 --> 00:27:57,599
she may not make it through the night.

404
00:27:59,799 --> 00:28:00,919
Lingdang.

405
00:28:01,039 --> 00:28:02,200
Lingdang.

406
00:28:15,100 --> 00:28:19,540
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

407
00:28:22,060 --> 00:28:26,540
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

408
00:28:28,020 --> 00:28:31,980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

409
00:28:32,420 --> 00:28:35,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

410
00:28:35,980 --> 00:28:41,420
♪Though all the world may fade, time
rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

411
00:28:42,940 --> 00:28:47,180
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

412
00:28:49,860 --> 00:28:54,500
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

413
00:28:56,100 --> 00:28:59,679
♪Every joy and sorrow in
this fleeting life fades into the past♪

414
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,479
Yinchen.

415
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:03,260
♪As new wounds rise♪

416
00:29:03,860 --> 00:29:09,900
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

417
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,720
Take me to Rongzhang House.

418
00:29:14,660 --> 00:29:17,579
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

419
00:29:17,580 --> 00:29:21,540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

420
00:29:21,580 --> 00:29:24,059
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

421
00:29:24,060 --> 00:29:28,339
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

422
00:29:28,340 --> 00:29:31,579
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

423
00:29:31,580 --> 00:29:35,219
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

424
00:29:35,220 --> 00:29:40,620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

425
00:29:57,799 --> 00:29:59,399
Lingdang.

426
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,800
Don't just stand around.

427
00:30:17,079 --> 00:30:18,760
Don't you all have work to do?

428
00:30:23,319 --> 00:30:24,280
Right.

429
00:30:24,880 --> 00:30:25,800
Right.

430
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,879
Get back to your work.

431
00:30:28,759 --> 00:30:29,879
Second Madam.

432
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:33,879
Clean that room up properly.

433
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,679
Make sure it's spotless.

434
00:30:36,079 --> 00:30:37,240
Yes.

435
00:30:38,279 --> 00:30:39,200
Xiuwan.

436
00:30:39,279 --> 00:30:40,200
Xiuwan.

437
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,679
Come on. Take a walk with me.

438
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:45,280
Yinxian.

439
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:47,599
Go look after Cuique.

440
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:50,599
Let's go.

441
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:18,879
What's wrong?

442
00:31:19,559 --> 00:31:21,359
I've never seen her like this.

443
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:26,399
Lingdang is dead.

444
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:29,439
This...

445
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,679
She was fine yesterday.

446
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:35,879
How did she suddenly die?

447
00:31:37,079 --> 00:31:38,200
The epidemic.

448
00:31:39,128 --> 00:31:40,264
Even if it was the epidemic,

449
00:31:40,312 --> 00:31:41,750
it shouldn't have happened this fast.

450
00:31:41,759 --> 00:31:42,399
The others...

451
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:43,879
Yinchen said

452
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:48,960
Yuchan may not make it through tonight.

453
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:42,159
Maybe Young Master will return today.

454
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:47,040
What if Young Master
doesn't return until tomorrow?

455
00:32:49,559 --> 00:32:51,839
Can Yuchan hold on until tomorrow?

456
00:32:56,400 --> 00:32:58,159
We're only maids.

457
00:32:59,559 --> 00:33:01,480
Other than waiting
and leaving it to fate,

458
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,800
there's nothing we can do.

459
00:33:08,359 --> 00:33:10,399
Who says there's nothing we can do?

460
00:33:12,880 --> 00:33:14,079
There is something we can do.

461
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:28,280
Yuchan worked so hard
to climb out of hardship.

462
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:30,879
She still wants to live a good life.

463
00:33:32,240 --> 00:33:34,679
Xiaolian still wants
to become a first-class maid

464
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:37,919
so her mother won't have to collect
night soil late at night anymore.

465
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:41,760
Madam Wu may
be shrewd and a little fierce,

466
00:33:42,640 --> 00:33:44,439
but she's fair in
how she handles things.

467
00:33:45,039 --> 00:33:47,040
She never shortchanges the junior maids.

468
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:53,399
She's still waiting for Jiugao to marry
so she can become a mother-in-law.

469
00:34:00,160 --> 00:34:02,000
None of them has lived long enough.

470
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:05,079
No one is allowed to die.

471
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:08,399
We have to save them.

472
00:34:24,079 --> 00:34:24,999
Hua.

473
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:26,158
The left side

474
00:34:26,159 --> 00:34:27,559
needs to be fumigated, too.

475
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:43,359
Second Madam has probably

476
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:45,038
never seen a dead body in her life.

477
00:34:45,039 --> 00:34:47,158
She must be upset and frightened,

478
00:34:47,159 --> 00:34:48,600
so she's keeping her distance.

479
00:34:49,079 --> 00:34:51,158
Fortunately, Young Lady Du
knows medicine.

480
00:34:51,159 --> 00:34:53,078
Once we've finished cleaning the room,

481
00:34:53,079 --> 00:34:55,479
Second Madam
can stay here without worry.

482
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:57,559
That's right.

483
00:35:00,760 --> 00:35:02,760
Young Lady Du, Madam Han,

484
00:35:02,840 --> 00:35:04,118
have some tea and take a break.

485
00:35:04,119 --> 00:35:04,959
Yes.

486
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:05,959
Have some tea first

487
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,399
and soothe your throats.

488
00:35:08,559 --> 00:35:09,879
Thank you for your help.

489
00:35:10,639 --> 00:35:12,359
Think nothing of it.

490
00:35:13,599 --> 00:35:14,839
Now that Lingdang is gone,

491
00:35:14,840 --> 00:35:17,080
Young Lady Du,
please don't stand on ceremony.

492
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:20,158
Treat these maids as your own

493
00:35:20,159 --> 00:35:21,600
and feel free to give them orders.

494
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,879
Ever since I entered the residence,

495
00:35:26,039 --> 00:35:29,200
everyone from First Madam to the nannies
has treated me with great care.

496
00:35:29,519 --> 00:35:31,999
I've never considered
myself an outsider.

497
00:35:32,199 --> 00:35:33,678
That's right.

498
00:35:33,679 --> 00:35:36,200
First Madam likes that about you.

499
00:36:50,119 --> 00:36:51,479
I need to relieve myself.

500
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:52,959
Me too.

501
00:36:55,639 --> 00:36:57,080
With all that filth,

502
00:36:57,679 --> 00:36:58,319
I can't believe

503
00:36:58,320 --> 00:37:00,160
you've managed to survive.

504
00:37:00,199 --> 00:37:01,680
You may not care if you live,

505
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:03,600
but I'm not ready to die yet.

506
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:04,839
Get down!

507
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,519
In a moment,

508
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:12,439
you watch Young Master's back.

509
00:37:12,519 --> 00:37:13,959
Charge straight ahead.

510
00:37:14,079 --> 00:37:15,600
I'll watch your back.

511
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:17,240
If you kill an odd number,

512
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:18,559
they're all yours.

513
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:20,080
If you kill an even number,

514
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,039
we split them evenly.

515
00:37:24,280 --> 00:37:25,160
Deal.

516
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:33,800
Here they come.

517
00:37:50,079 --> 00:37:51,238
We're here to ambush

518
00:37:51,239 --> 00:37:54,120
Commander Yuan
of the Xinjiangkou Naval Camp?

519
00:37:57,159 --> 00:37:58,320
Scared?

520
00:38:03,559 --> 00:38:05,359
We have to make a clean job of it.

521
00:38:05,679 --> 00:38:07,320
We can't leave anyone alive.

522
00:38:10,639 --> 00:38:11,959
A brother like you,

523
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:14,600
I, Lin Jinqi, will stand by for life.

524
00:38:18,559 --> 00:38:19,919
Look at their direction.

525
00:38:20,199 --> 00:38:23,120
Commander Yuan is heading
to Longjiang Shipyard.

526
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,559
Look.

527
00:38:27,519 --> 00:38:29,279
It should rain tonight.

528
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:32,160
The rain will wash away every trace.

529
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:34,919
As long as we do a clean job,

530
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,280
none of this
will have anything to do with us.

531
00:38:47,639 --> 00:38:49,080
What...

532
00:38:49,199 --> 00:38:51,519
How did someone beat us to it?

533
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:55,800
Chief.

534
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:58,158
Are we taking on both sides,

535
00:38:58,159 --> 00:38:59,999
or just one?

536
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:01,479
Wait a little longer.

537
00:39:07,719 --> 00:39:09,800
Kill them!

538
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:31,559
I am an official of the imperial court.

539
00:39:31,719 --> 00:39:33,118
I can say with a clear conscience

540
00:39:33,119 --> 00:39:34,839
that I have not failed
His Majesty's trust

541
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,680
or wronged the people.

542
00:39:37,079 --> 00:39:38,279
Who might you be

